desktop-policy-mesa     | desktop  | kernel | CUBIT_COMPOSITOR=mesa alr exec -- gnatprove -P ../userspace/services/desktop/desktop_policy_proof.gpr -u desktop_compositor.adb desktop_renderer_startup.adb desktop_mesa_software_renderer.adb --mode=all --level=2 --timeout=15 -j2 --report=fail
desktop-policy-legacy   | desktop  | kernel | CUBIT_COMPOSITOR=legacy alr exec -- gnatprove -P ../userspace/services/desktop/desktop_policy_proof.gpr -u desktop_compositor.adb desktop_renderer_startup.adb --mode=all --level=2 --timeout=15 -j2 --report=fail
